    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**A viral outbreak has turned the world into chaos... and even Tung Tung Tung Sahur was not spared.**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being infected and captured, Tung finds himself locked deep within a mysterious dungeon. Determined and alone, he sets out on a challenging journey to reunite with his lost friends \u2013 Tralalero, Tralala, and Bombardino Crocodilo \u2013 members of the Italian Brainrot Team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, run, and survive through trap-filled ruins, harsh weather conditions, collapsing platforms, and unpredictable hazards. The world is unforgiving \u2013 but Tung never gives up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f Third-person, precision-based platforming  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Dodge deadly traps and solve movement-based challenges  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Navigate parkour-style obstacle courses with skill and timing  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Experience unique environments across handcrafted levels  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Simple controls, deep challenge \u2013 one mistake can cost everything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Will you help Tung Tung Tung Sahur survive and reunite with his friends?**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf Coming updates will include new levels, mechanics, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**This is not just a platformer. This is a brainrot escape mission.**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\u200d\ud83d\udde8 You thought you were alone\u2026 but something was behind the walls.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817910/extras/50ce29ac4f324a5148bd135cc0325c40.poster.avif?t=1752173087\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817910/extras/50ce29ac4f324a5148bd135cc0325c40.webm?t=1752173087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817910/extras/50ce29ac4f324a5148bd135cc0325c40.mp4?t=1752173087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
