73087\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817910/extras/50ce29ac4f324a5148bd135cc0325c40.webm?t=1752173087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817910/extras/50ce29ac4f324a5148bd135cc0325c40.mp4?t=1752173087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
